# Cursor GitHub text

Shared project rules are in `AGENTS.md`. Do not copy them into this folder.

When you write a commit message, pull request description, review comment, or issue comment:

- Do not add "Made with Cursor" or "Generated by Cursor".
- Do not add an automatic AI-tool co-author trailer, such as `Co-authored-by: Cursor <...>`.
- Do not add a promotional line or product slogan.
- Keep required license or policy attribution that is already in the file.
- If the owner asks about AI help, or a policy requires disclosure, say the truth.
